{
 "what": "ITF1788, the interval test framework for IEEE Std 1788-2015 (Nehmeier, Kiesner; test libraries converted to ITL by Heimlich), one of the two test frameworks discussed by Benet, Ferranti & Revol, \"A framework to test interval arithmetic libraries and their IEEE 1788-2015 compliance\" (Concurrency Computat Pract Exper, doi:10.1002/cpe.7856). Every .itl file of the suite at one commit, the language description (README + the grammar) and the licences, pinned by sha256; each file's git blob hash was checked against the commit's tree at fetch time. Data only: nothing from this repository is executed here (tools/audit-kernel-itf1788.js parses the .itl files with its own Node parser). Licences: Apache 2.0, LGPL 2.1, and the FSF all-permissive notice, per file header.",
